			"Message": "style(Rest): reorder imports and standardize quote style\n\nReorganize import statements in bin/Rest.js to follow a more logical grouping:\nnode:path imports first, then node:url, then node:fs. Convert all string literals from double quotes to single quotes to match the project's JavaScript style guidelines.\n\nAlso refactor the execSync call to use a more concise single-line format.",
