			"Message": "style(Rest): make shell scripts POSIX-compliant\n\nConvert bash-specific scripts to portable POSIX sh syntax by:\n- Changing shebang from bash to sh in all three scripts\n- Removing bash-only features (local keyword, [[ operator, $BASH_SOURCE)\n- Replacing ANSI color codes with plain text output\n- Adjusting variable assignments and test conditions for sh compatibility\n\nThis improves portability across different Unix-like systems and shells.",
